d/docker-apprise-api/compare/v2.1.0-ls10...v2.2.0-ls11","upstream":"## What's Changed\r\nThis release introduces Reminders :clock10: !   You can now set and forget your reminders.  The mobile app being launched soon will also help support these scheduled reminders at the palm of your hand from anywhere.\r\n\r\nAdded Reminder/Task support to Apprise - Set it and Forget it! :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n- By Date<br/><img width=\"789\" height=\"336\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08a770be-a380-49b7-b281-a5f4322cc1d2\" />\r\n- Date Range (recurring notifications)<br/><img width=\"1087\" height=\"525\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c233ab7-6b6d-4231-92fc-27bed4c285d2\" />\r\n\r\n- By Holiday too!<br/><img width=\"1087\" height=\"500\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/553c06ef-c792-4f3f-a7cb-4495dfc35d47\" />\r\n\r\n## :bulb: Features\r\n* Updated to reflect new iOS/Apple Mobile support in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/373\r\n* :fire: Reminders/Tasks Support Added `/reminder/` in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/388\r\n* Refresh reminder buttons and update libraries in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/389\r\n* Add an auto theme that follows the system light or dark setting in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/390\r\n* Allow APPRISE_ASSET_* variables to set any Apprise asset option in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/391\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/compare/v2.1.0...v2.2.0","upstream_url":"https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/releases/tag/v2.2.0"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/root","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","APPRISE_CONFIG_DIR=/config","APPRISE_ATTACH_DIR=/attachme